Package: alberdilabr
Title: Scaffold Reproducible, Publication-Ready 'bookdown' Websites
Version: 0.1.2
Authors@R: 
    person("Antton", "Alberdi", , "antton.alberdi@sund.ku.dk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Creates opinionated, reproducible publication projects that render
    with 'bookdown' and deploy to GitHub Pages through GitHub Actions. The
    package scaffolds the project, manages chapter files and their ordering,
    and validates project structure. Generated projects are ordinary 'bookdown'
    projects that remain renderable without this package.
